 are cross-trained in this regard and are exp... View Details Bookmark Part-Time Administrative Assistant - Ashbrook Center S1142P Ashbrook Staff We are seeking a dependable, organized, and proactive Part-Time Administrative Assistant to support the day-to-day operations of the Ashbrook Center. The ideal candidate is a self-starter who can work independently, prioritize responsibilities, and provide professional and welcoming support to staff, interns, and visitors.Duties include, but are not limited to:Answer the main phone line, take m... View Details Bookmark Part-Time Deli Server - Student Dining S1140P Convocation Center (Student Dining) Staff Set up Deli station in the morning.Organize bread rack and resupply based on the the days requirements.Stock coolers and fill condiment bottles for the day.Maintain a clean and sanitary work station.Position works Monday-Friday 8:00 a.m. – 2:30 p.m., 11:00 a.m. – 7:30 p.m. every other weekend. View Details Bookmark Desktop Engineer - Information Technology S1136P Information Technology Staff The Desktop Engineer is a forward-thinking IT professional responsible for ensuring optimal desktop and endpoint operations across our diverse environment. This role not only covers traditional desktop support but also integrates modern endpoint management practices including cloud and mobile device management (MDM), cybersecurity fundamentals, and server-level administration. The successful ca... View Details Bookmark Full-Time Salad Prep - Student Dining S1139P Convocation Center (Student Dining) Staff Covers days off for other employees. Schedule will vary from a.m. to p.m. along with every other weekend.Duties include vegetable prep, salad composition, assembling catering traysand salads.Stocks and maintains raw ingredients for Student Dining salad bar.May be required to work other positions based on staffing needs. View Details Bookmark Principal Faculty for the Master of Science in Physician Assistant Studies- Part Time - Schar College of Nursing and Health Sciences F129P Medical Sciences Faculty The Part-Time Principal Faculty member for the Master of Science in Physician Assistant Studies Program will work closely with the Program Director and Principal Faculty members to implement and maintain the curriculum in accordance with ARC-PA Standards as a course director on a twelve (12) month, part-time basis. As a Course Director the individual is responsible for development, implementati... View Details Bookmark Head Women's Lacrosse Coach - Athletics S1135P Athletics Staff Ashland University is an NCAA Division II institution that competes in the Great Midwest Athletic Conference (GMAC). Ashland University offers a comprehensive 24-sport athletic program.The university is located off of Interstate 71 in Ashland, Ohio, midway between Cleveland and Columbus.Candidates must be able to teach proper technique and skill development in various aspects of lacrosse. Candi... View Details Bookmark Site Coordinator - Chillicothe Correctional Institution (Ohio) - Correctional Education S1134P Correctional Education Program Staff The Site Coordinator provides administrative support for Ashland University Correctional Education staff and students. The Site Coordinator reports directly to the designated Correctional Education State Director.Oversee daily operations at the assigned correctional facility(ies)/site(s) and represent the university in collaboration with the State Department of Corrections (DOC).Act as the liai... View Details Bookmark Full-Time Grill Cook - Eagles Nest S1117P Eagle's Nest Staff Prepare ala carte breakfast and lunch items for students, staff, and guests of Ashland University.Set up breakfast station for the days orders and efficiently transition to lunch.Maintain a clean and organized station throughout service.Stock station and prep additional items as needed.Maintain orders from Grubhub as well as in-house orders.Assist in monthly Inventory counting and monitor stock... View