ls Bookmark Staff Accountant - Business Office S1120P Business Office Staff The Staff Accountant supports the daily financial operations of the Business Office by processing transactions, maintaining records, and ensuring documentation is complete and accurate in accordance with established policies and procedures.Administer and support the University purchasing card (P-Card) program, including card issuance, training, policy compliance monitoring, review of supporting... View Details Bookmark Discovery Development Officer - Institutional Advancement S1130P Development Staff Ashland University seeks a motivated and relationship-focused Discovery Development Officer (DXO) to join the Institutional Advancement team. This frontline fundraising position plays a vital role in building the University’s pipeline of future leadership and major gift donors by identifying, researching, qualifying, and engaging alumni, parents, and friends with the capacity and interest to su... View Details Bookmark Director of Student Activities - Office of Student & Residence Life S1128P Student Life Staff As a key member of Student Life and Success at Ashland University, the Director of Student Activities is responsible for creating significant opportunities for student engagement that foster a sense of belonging, learning and personal/professional growth, while also aiding in student retention.Coordinate/plan, implement and evaluate traditional campus-wide events including the Involvement Fair,... View Details Bookmark Site Coordinator, Grafton Correctional Institution and Grafton Reintegration Center (Ohio) - Correctional Education S1101P Correctional Education Program Staff The Site Coordinator provides administrative support for Ashland University Correctional Education staff and students. The Site Coordinator reports directly to the designated Correctional Education State Director.Oversee daily operations at the assigned correctional facility(ies)/site(s) and represent the university in collaboration with the State Department of Corrections (DOC).Act as the liai... View Details Bookmark Casual Talon Transport Drivers - Student Affairs S1116P International Student Services Staff Ashland University is seeking dependable, friendly drivers to join our Talon Transport team. Drivers provide transportation for students, faculty, and staff to destinations throughout Ohio, including airports, medical appointments, internships, government offices, and more. If you enjoy driving and making a difference in the student experience, we’d love to hear from you!Position Details:Flexib... View Details Bookmark Full-Time Building Service Worker - Building Services S1125P Building Services Staff Cleaning and maintaining living facilities, dining areas, laundry areas, restrooms, shower areas, classrooms and offices.Replenishing soap and paper products.Removing trash and recycling from buildings while replacing liners in the trash and recycling containers.Sweeping, mopping and cleaning floors and stairwells.Vacuuming and shampooing carpeted areas.Dusting furniture, washing walls and wind... View Details Bookmark Sales and Marketing Manager, Catering and Conferences S1127P Catering Staff The Ashland University Catering and Conferences Sales and Marketing Manager will work directly with clients and potential clients to secure their business and plan events. This position will also work with internal AU clients to generate BEOs for their events. This position is also responsible for all print and digital marketing for Catering and Conferences including brochures, menus, website, ... View Details Bookmark Site Coordinator - Noble Correctional Institution (OH) - Correctional Education S1124P Correctional Education Program Staff The Site Coordinator provides administrative support for Ashland University Correctional Education staff and students. The Site Coordinator reports directly to the designated Correctional Education State Director.Oversee daily operations at the assigned correctional facility(ies)/site(s) and represent the university in collaboration with the State Department of Corrections (DOC).Act as the liai... View Details Bookmark Site Coordinator - South Central Correctional Center (Missouri) - Correctional Education S978P Correctional Education Program Staff The Site Coordinator provides administrative support for Ashland University Correctional Education staff and students. The Site Coordinator reports directly to the designated Correctional Education State Director.Oversee daily operations at the assigned correctional facility(ies)/site(s) and represent the university in collaboration with the State Department of Corrections (DOC).Act as the liai... View Details Bookmark Seminary Grants Finance & Compliance Manager - Ashland Theological Seminary S1095P Seminary Staff Ashland Theological Seminary (ATS) equips modern‑day disciples to serve as leaders and counselors in diverse ministry and professional contexts. The ATS Grants team supports this mission by cultivating partnerships, designing and delivering high-quality non-academic programming, and stewarding grant funding for strategic innovation and institutional learning. Our current portfolio includes prog... View Details Bookmark Financial Aid Counselor - Financial Aid Office S1085P Financial Aid Staff The main functions of the Financial Aid Office are to effectively and comprehensively assist students and parents through the financial aid process and efficiently manage federal, state, and institutional financial aid programs. The Financial Aid Counselor provides financial aid services to undergraduate and graduate students as well as correctional education students across the country. The Fi... View Details Bookmark Administrative Assistant to the Director - Columbus Center S1122P Professional Learning Staff This full-time position is under the supervision of, and reports to, the Director of Professional Learning Services (PLS). The Administrative Assistant provides support services to PLS. The Administrative Assistant reports directly to the Director of PLS at the Ashland University Columbus, OH Center.Completes administrative office and clerical work including serving as a resource person to info... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Practical Theology - Ashland Theological Seminary F115P Seminary Faculty Ethos of Ashland Theological SeminaryAshland Theological Seminary, founded by the Brethren Church, allows its Anabaptist and Pietist heritage to shape the core values of the Seminary. The Seminary is an evangelical and ecumenical institution, as well as a community of faith with an identity shaped by its service to the scholarly community, the church, and the world. We embrace a diversity that ... View Details Bookmark Family Nurse Practitioner (FNP) Coordinator ADJ075P Nursing Adjunct Hires Position Summary:The FNP Coordinator is responsible for providing overall leadership and oversight for the FNP track, providing leadership in the graduate program in collaboration with the Director of Graduate Nursing Programs.Essential Duties and Responsibilities:An Adjunct FNP Coordinator will:Support the mission of Ashland University and Dwight Schar College of Nursing and Health SciencesSup... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 Next 401 College Avenue Ashland, OH 44805 419.289.4142, 800.882.1548 Athletics Employment Commencement News Center Accessibility Back to top Wellness Consumer Information Student Complaints Campus Store To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
